# THE EMPTY PIECE (0.17.31, Niclio's "can I make a song from nothing?", issue #5): on Global, SEL + OCT- empties the piece playing: no drums,
# the pad holding one chord, the bass, the acid and the pluck on their steps with every step a rest. Nothing but the pad sounds until
# something is written; SAVE keeps it as it is (through a power cycle), and a step written plays.
seed 0
seamless 1
wait 2500
expect playing 1
tap GLO
wait 100
expect view 33
press SEL
tap OCT-
release SEL
wait 200
expect msgon 1
expect par152 16
expect acidgate 0
expect bskind15 0
expect bsoct15 1
expect prgplay 1
# nothing but the pad, from a fresh start
hasharm 8000
tap PLAY
wait 300
tap PLAY
wait 9000
expect notes 0
# stored, and after a power cycle still empty
expect view 33
tap SAVE
wait 1500
reboot
wait 2500
expect par152 16
expect acidgate 0
expect bsoct15 1
hasharm 8000
tap PLAY
wait 300
tap PLAY
wait 9000
expect notes 0
# a bass step written (the first white key, a note): it plays
tap LFO
tap LFO
tap LFO
tap LFO
tap LFO
wait 100
expect view 10
tapkey 1
spin K1 1
wait 100
expect bskind0 1
expect bsany 1
hasharm 8000
tap PLAY
wait 300
tap PLAY
wait 9000
expect notes >3
